From 9e000ed91298a9ef4a36231891c8257ee9dacdd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 11:52:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05047/11362] [conductor] Checkpoint: preserve uncommitted work
